# Petty Cash Voucher
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Petty Cash — every expense recorded against the fund's running balance
# Case 6 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: pettycash-fund.menata

Petty Cash Voucher

Fields

- Fund : Petty Cash Fund
- Voucher Number : Text
- Voucher Date : Date
- Amount : Money
- Expense Category : Supplies | Transport | Meals | Utilities | Miscellaneous
- Description : Rich Text
- Recorded By : User
- Status : Draft | Reconciled

Events

When Record

    Recorded By Current User

    Fund Current Balance must be greater than or equal to Amount

Constraints

- Fund is required.
- Voucher Number is required.
- Voucher Date is required.
- Amount is required.
- Description is required.

    Fund Current Balance must be greater than or equal to Amount.

Permissions

Custodian

- Record

Views

- Voucher Form : Form
- Voucher List : List
- Voucher Detail : Detail
